# Mobile + desktop (Fase 5 / FireDrill)

Baca `docs/mobile-ux-spec.md` dan `docs/mobile-testing.md` sebelum mengubah UI shell/sheet/topbar/toast/tour atau e2e.

## Wajib
- Layout `< 1024px` = bottom sheet custom existing; `≥ 1024px` = panel kanan. Respon ke perubahan viewport/orientasi.
- Short landscape: default peek; canvas tinggi usable (≥ ~40% viewport). Jangan biarkan canvas ~16px.
- Tap target ≥ 44px. Jangan info penting hanya via `:hover` / `pointerenter`.
- Meta viewport + `viewport-fit=cover`; pakai `env(safe-area-inset-*)` dan `dvh`/`svh` (hindari `100vh` mentah untuk panel).
- Toast satu instance; tidak overlap handle sheet.
- Brand in-app **FireDrill**; URL publik lewat `src/core/siteConfig.js` saja — jangan hardcode domain di banyak file. Domain/DNS/Vercel subdomain = manual Barkah.
- Setiap task UI: bukti Playwright (screenshot mobile+desktop) + update `docs/progress.md`, `decisions.md`, `known-issues.md`.

## Dilarang
- Menambah framework UI / Tailwind / dependency di luar `docs/tech-stack.md`.
- Mengganti sheet custom dengan `pure-web-bottom-sheet` di Fase 5 tanpa keputusan baru.
- Menganggap tour/perf "lulus" tanpa bukti di progress.
